512x512
A dramatic night sky filled with swirling nebulae, distant stars, and two glowing moons—one silver, one crimson—hanging over an ancient magical arena floating among the clouds. The left side shows the Azure Spire, a majestic tower carved from luminous blue crystal and pale marble with glowing sapphire runes, waterfalls of liquid starlight, and floating blue spellbooks. The right side shows the Crimson Citadel, a fortress of dark volcanic rock with glowing crimson ore, jagged spikes, molten energy rivers, and spinning rings of fire. The atmosphere is a blend of cool blue and warm red-orange hues, with mist and heat waves swirling around the towers.
